OL,3,GNEWSAGuernsey prison population highest
OL,4,Asince 2019
OL,5,
OL,6,FGuernsey's prison population is at its
OL,7,Fhighest since early 2019, figures show.
OL,9,FCurrently 95 inmates are housed at Les
OL,10,FNicolles in St Sampson's, the highest
OL,11,Fsince April 2019, when 97 inmates were
OL,12,Fdetained.
OL,14,FThe prison has accommodation to house a
OL,15,Fmaximum of 134 prisoners. Of the
OL,16,Fcurrent population, the majority of
OL,17,Fprisoners were in for sex offences.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
