OL,3,GNEWSAGuernsey prison population highest
OL,4,Asince 2019
OL,5,
OL,6,FGuernsey Prison has been contacted for
OL,7,Fcomment. Previously leadership at the
OL,8,Fprison had blamed the UK not taking
OL,9,Finmates because of overcrowding in its
OL,10,Fjustice system.
